{"id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-letterless-rank-trace.md","title":"Rank Semantics and GL Order for Letterless Formulas","display":"thm-letterless-rank-trace — Rank Semantics and GL Order for Letterless Formulas","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace","aliases":["89-thm-letterless-rank-trace"],"display":"thm-letterless-rank-trace — Rank Semantics and GL Order for Letterless Formulas","depends_on":["[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","[[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-letterless-rank-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-letterless-rank-trace — Rank Semantics and GL Order for Letterless Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" href=\"?note=4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" title=\"89-df-letterless-trace\">89-df-letterless-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8eb27a8b07c2dc2b\" href=\"?note=8eb27a8b07c2dc2b\" title=\"89-lem-finite-rank-successors\">89-lem-finite-rank-successors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F\">\\(\\rho_F\\)</span> 为路径秩，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tr}\">\\(\\mathrm{tr}\\)</span> 为无字母迹，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}rank\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho_F(w)\\in\\mathrm{tr}(A),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)=\\omega,\\\\\n(A\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{tr}(B),\\\\\n(A\\leftrightarrow B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)=\\mathrm{tr}(B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}rank\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho_F(w)\\in\\mathrm{tr}(A),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)=\\omega,\\\\\n(A\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{tr}(B),\\\\\n(A\\leftrightarrow B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)=\\mathrm{tr}(B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 94–96；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>第一式对实际构造子归纳；盒情形使用后继秩集合恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,\\rho_F(w)-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,\\rho_F(w)-1\\}\\)</span>，而非仅使用“后继秩更小”。若一个迹缺失 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，取载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>、关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"iRj\\iff i&gt;j\">\\(iRj\\iff i&gt;j\\)</span>，根 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的秩正好为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，反驳该公式。结合有限 GL 可靠性与完全性得到第二式。第三、四式把第二式分别应用于蕴含和等价，并用迹的布尔条款。它们提供正规形等价性的确切判据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-letterless-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4f8d035bfd71a4ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-finite-rank-successors","status":"resolved","id":"8eb27a8b07c2dc2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}rank\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho_F(w)\\in\\mathrm{tr}(A),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)=\\omega,\\\\\n(A\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{tr}(B),\\\\\n(A\\leftrightarrow B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{tr}(A)=\\mathrm{tr}(B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,\\rho_F(w)-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"iRj\\iff i>j","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1687,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"636cbfa2301b039f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c45e0059ab7065e5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["4f8d035bfd71a4ab","8eb27a8b07c2dc2b","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","0157f8bea9275cf1"]}